OL,3,GNEWSADad's fight against maggot
OL,4,Ainfestation advances
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents living in apartment blocks
OL,7,Fwhich have become a hotbed for maggots
OL,8,Fduring the summer months have been
OL,9,Fpromised help by councillors.
OL,11,FMaggots and flies are a persistent
OL,12,Fproblem in the bin stores of a number
OL,13,Fof buildings in Runnymede Borough
OL,14,FCouncil's Addlestone One development
OL,15,Fproject, residents say.
OL,17,FJon Joyce, a leaseholder in Dunsfold
OL,18,FHouse who lives with his wife and
OL,19,F14-month-old baby daughter, said
OL,20,Fmaggots crawled under the bin room door
OL,21,Fand out into the main foyer.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
